\fs14\
\fs28 The following implementation example (which is paired with\b  \b0 the\b  stringForObjectValue: \b0 example below) converts an NSString representation of a dollar amount that includes the dollar sign; it uses an NSScanner to convert this amount to a float after stripping out the initial dollar sign. \
